    2-2.25  Init (Modem String)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Modem string sent to modem to initalize the modem when the node is first
    loaded.


    2-2.26  Reset (Modem String)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Modem string sent to modem to reset modem and get it ready for next
    call.


    2-2.27  Hangup (Modem String)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Modem string sent to modem to hang up user.


    2-2.28  Answer (Modem String)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Modem string sent to modem to answer an incomming call.


    2-2.29  OffHook (Modem String)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Modem string sent to modem to place modem off hook (Busy).


    2-2.30  OnHook (Modem String)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Modem string sent to modem to place modem on hook (Ready for call).


    2-2.31  Ring (Detect String)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    String used to detect a ring.


    2-2.32  Connect (Detect String)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    String used to detect a connect message.
    Default 'CONNECT ' <- Notice the space after the word connect!


