        3)  Allow Public Msgs
        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
        Allow the posting of public messages in this area.
        Recommended setting of: Checked


        4)  Allow Private Msgs
        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
        Allow the posting of private messages in this area.
        Recommended setting of: Checked


        5)  Allow Anonymous Msgs
        ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
