    2-23.1  Area
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Select Area to clean.


    2-23.2  Sub
    ~~~~~~~~~~~
    Select Sub Listing in area to clean.
    0 = Current Upload Listing


    2-23.3  Remove
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Remove what type of entries.

    - Offline List - This removes all entries that have been marked as offline
                     in the file listing. (not shown any longer)

    - Offline HD   - This removes all entries that have been flagged to show
                     that files are no longer on the hard drive.


    - Both List&HD - Removes both List and HD flags mentioned above.

  
