    Must have Remove gadget toggled to "Cut Beginning" to activate this
    gadget.


    2-23.5  Backup
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    This determines whether or not a backup copy of the old files listing 
    should be stored.
    NOTE: Once you clean up the area again, old backups are erased or 
          replaced with new backup.


    2-23.6  Start
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    After selecting all gadgets above, you are ready to hit the start gadget
    and have the operation performed on the file listing.
    After hitting this gadget you will notice the scanning text gadgets will
    display how many entries there are and what the current entry scan is on.
    Also mentions what entries are being stripped out of the listing.


